Ha ha ha.
哈哈哈哈。

00:50:18.679 --> 00:50:20.139
Ha ha ha ha.
哈哈哈哈。

00:50:20.139 --> 00:50:21.559
There's lots of friends, just shut up.
有很多朋友，闭嘴吧。

00:50:21.559 --> 00:50:22.579
All right.
好了。

